[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u898B\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u306A\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you sure it\u0027s okay for me to look?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306F\u4FE1\u983C\u3057\u3066\n\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3089\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u306B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I trust you, Logy.\nBesides..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u7269\u3060\u3063\u3066\u898B\u305B\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u305D\u306E\u4FE1\u983C\u306B\u306F\u7B54\u3048\u306D\u3070\u306A\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re showing me yours as well.\nI must honor that trust."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3042\u898B\u305B\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u305E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, then I\u0027ll take a look."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304A\u3001\u3053\u308C\u304C\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u5263\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u60F3\u50CF\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u901A\u308A\u3001\u7D20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u51FA\u6765\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, so this is your Alchemic Sword...\nIt\u0027s as magnificent as I imagined."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u306E\u5263\u3082\u3059\u3054\u3044\u306A\u2026\u2026\u3002\u8907\u96D1\u306A\u6A5F\u69CB\u3060\u3068\u306F\n\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u304C\u3001\u305D\u308C\u305E\u308C\u306B\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u610F\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your sword is incredible too... I knew the mechanism was complex, but every part has its purpose."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8ABF\u5408\u54C1\u306B\u306F\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306E\u500B\u6027\u304C\u51FA\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3002\n\u81EA\u5206\u3060\u3051\u304C\u4F7F\u3046\u6B66\u5668\u3068\u306A\u308C\u3070\u306A\u304A\u3055\u3089\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An alchemist\u0027s personality shows in their synthesis.\nEspecially in weapons meant for their own use."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u3092\u898B\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3067\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306E\u4EBA\u3068\u306A\u308A\u304C\n\u4F1D\u308F\u3063\u3066\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just looking at this tells me so much about\nwho you are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u308B\u3068\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u6065\u305A\u304B\u3057\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When you put it that way, it\u0027s kind of embarrassing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6065\u305A\u304B\u3057\u304C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u307E\u3063\u3059\u3050\u306A\u5FC3\u304C\u898B\u3048\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There\u0027s no need to be embarrassed.\nIt simply shows your honest nature."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u79C1\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u3055\u3089\u3051\u51FA\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, I\u0027ve laid bare my own nature to you as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3001\u305D\u3046\u304B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I suppose that\u0027s true..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u3063\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah yes, please take this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What\u0027s this...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u5263\u7528\u306B\u8ABF\u5408\u3057\u305F\u7279\u88FD\u306E\u7825\u77F3\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u79C1\u306E\u898B\u7ACB\u3066\u306B\u9593\u9055\u3044\u304C\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u5207\u308C\u5473\u304C\u4E0A\u304C\u308B\u306F\u305A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A special whetstone I synthesized for your Alchemic Sword.\nIf my assessment is correct, it should improve its sharpness."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you sure?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u306F\u8272\u3005\u304A\u4E16\u8A71\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3002\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u304C\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u3067\u826F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. You\u0027ve helped me in many ways.\nI\u0027m glad you were the one assigned to watch over me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u308B\u306A\u3089\u3053\u3063\u3061\u3082\u826F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you feel that way, then I\u0027m glad too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u306F\u3084\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\n\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u8ABF\u5408\u3057\u305F\u3082\u306E\u3092\u3058\u3063\u304F\u308A\u89B3\u5BDF\n\u3067\u304D\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u5922\u306E\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My goodness, thank you.\nTo think I\u0027d get to closely examine synthesis\nwork from another land... it\u0027s like a dream."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305C\u3072\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3082\u8272\u3005\u304A\u8A71\u3092\n\u805E\u304B\u305B\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3068\u306F\u9577\u3044\u4ED8\u304D\u5408\u3044\u306B\u306A\u308A\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please continue to share your knowledge with me.\nI have a feeling this will be a long friendship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u3053\u3061\u3089\u3053\u305D\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u983C\u3080\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I look forward to working with you too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u5F7C\u3068\u63A5\u3057\u3066\u307F\u3066\n\u3000\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Being around him has helped me\nunderstand something...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5143\u6975\u591C\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u515A\u3001\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3002\n\u3000\u77E5\u3089\u306A\u3044\u77E5\u8B58\u306B\u76EE\u3092\u8F1D\u304B\u305B\u308B\u5F7C\u306F\u3001\n\u3000\u6839\u3063\u304B\u3089\u306E\u60AA\u3044\u5974\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Walther, former member of the Polar Night Alchemists.\nThe way his eyes light up at new knowledge...\nHe\u0027s not truly a bad person at heart.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3002\u9045\u304F\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u3000\u7F6A\u306F\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3001\u511F\u3048\u308B\u306F\u305A\u306A\u306E\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It\u0027s not too late.\nI\u0027m sure he can still atone for his sins.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]